              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TimeOrderedProduct"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set"} set
              of arguments, not on the order of the arguments. We will write
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
