                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{R} \leftrightarrow \mathcal{R}^{-1}
            in order to bring out the analogy to (the conventions for the)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/time-ordered+product"} time-ordered product
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi A
                    %mn 1
