            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/extension+of+distributions"} extension of distributions
            is introduced, following (
            %a{:href => "perturbative+algebraic+quantum+field+theory#Stora93"}> Stora 93
            ). Review is in (
            %a{:href => "perturbative+algebraic+quantum+field+theory#Duetsch18"}> Dütsch 18, section 3.3.2
