            %p
              This means that a renormalization condition is a condition that may consistently be imposed degreewise in an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/induction"} inductive
              construction of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/time-ordered+products"} time-ordered products
              by degreewise
