                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma\left( (g S_{int} + j A)_{i = 1}^v\right) \in PolyObs(E_{\text{BV-BRST}})((\hbar))[ [ g, j ] ]
            %p
              We say that the corresponding
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/effective+action"} effective action
              is
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi i
                    %mi ℏ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} i \hbar
              times the sub-series
            #eq:ExpansionEffectiveAction.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (22)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
